    <unit id="=&gt;q2" name="=&gt;q2">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">4</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Even though you see the reflection of the lively flame in his eyes, liveliness is one attribute which cannot be ascribed to them: They are vacant and pointed at a bottle of cold brew in front of him, untouched; his respirator is still on his face.

There's a small dirty spade leaned against the shack wall.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q3" name="=&gt;q3">
      <mda:metadata>
